And we're going to explore how this law reshapes Medicaid funding nationally, right, while also

00:01:07.020 --> 00:01:11.060
unpacking that unique, really precarious funding, cliff-facing Puerto Rico.

00:01:11.060 --> 00:01:13.260
Okay, let's unpack this, because this is huge.

00:01:13.260 --> 00:01:14.260
It is.

